{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:NuclearInteractions.SpectatorNormalization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"NuclearInteractions.SpectatorNormalization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.spectatorSignPattern","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.spectatorSignPattern","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/spectator-normalization.lean#L64-L107","doc":"The parity regime: for q > 1, both channel sums are negative,\nso sign(a^Z × b^N) = (−1)^{Z+N}. The spectator product is\npositive when Z + N is even (odd A in beta decay). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.spectatorSign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.spectatorSign","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/spectator-normalization.lean#L28-L50","doc":"Both channel sums are negative for q > 1, giving the\nfermionic sign: sign(a^Z × b^{N-1}) = (−1)^{A−1}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.spectatorNorm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.spectatorNorm","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/spectator-normalization.lean#L22-L26","doc":"Spectator normalization: product of per-nucleon channel sums\nfor unchanged nucleons in a beta decay.\nS(Z, N-1) = a^Z × b^{N-1}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutronChannelSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.neutronChannelSum","kind":"def","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/spectator-normalization.lean#L18-L20","doc":"The neutron channel sum: b = −3(q²−1)(q²+1)²/(4q³). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.protonChannelSum'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.protonChannelSum'","kind":"def","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/spectator-normalization.lean#L15-L16","doc":"The proton channel sum: a = −(q − q⁻¹)/2. ","signatureChunk":0}]}